        <h2 class="headline headline--sm">Ethics</h2>
        <p>In today's world, where stress is a constant and unhealthy eating has become the norm, finding a balance between mind and body is vital. That is exactly where Etica_Lab.Equilibrium comes in. Our laboratory is not just a place to learn to cook — it is a space where you can find harmony between your mind and your body, and begin to question what is right for you and what is not. Because only you know that.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="headline headline--sm">Physical, mental and emotional balance.</h2>
        <p>Self-knowledge and wellbeing have become priorities for many people. More and more are looking to improve their quality of life through healthy eating that fits naturally into their daily lives. But it is equally important to consider ethics and sustainability in the wellness space. The premises at the foundation of our current education have expired. The goals we had fifty years ago are not the goals of today. We must learn to question ourselves — and in doing so, create the model that actually works for us.</p>
      </div>
